{{Documentation/Header}}
Renders a red "Open Playlist on YouTube" button linking to a YouTube playlist. Place it wherever a full playlist should be offered alongside individual song links.

==Syntax==
{{T|YtP|v1=playlist ID}}

The playlist ID is the part of a YouTube URL after <code>list=</code> — it normally begins with <code>PL</code>.

==Examples==
{{T|YtP|_Y_=1|p1=PL73S0VEJz6VwGoivkooqW0GHeZZpPXPnf}}

Nothing is rendered if no ID is given, so an empty call is harmless.

